{"word":"πλεονέκτης","uri":"pleonektês","senses":[{"word":"πλεονέκτης","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">πλεονέκτης,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ου,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">adj. m.</span> qui cherche à avoir plus que les\nautres <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> plus qu’il ne doit,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> cupide, ambitieux,\n<span class=\"ital\">p. suite,</span> arrogant, <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 40, etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de choses :</span> <span class=\"grec\">πλ. λόγος</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 158</span>, discours intéressé ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> qui profite de ses\navantages sur, <span class=\"ital\">gén. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">πλ. τῶν πολεμίων</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 6, 27</span>,\nsur l’ennemi ||</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Sup.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πλεονεκτίστατος</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Mem.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 2, 12</span>\n(<span class=\"ital\">var. p.</span> <span class=\"grec\">κλεπτίστατος</span>).</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πλεονεκτέω</span>.</div>\n"}]}